OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA frosty start for many, but
OL,6,Flong sunny intervals are expected
OL,7,Fthrough the day. Cloudier for Cumbria
OL,8,Fwith isolated showers amongst bright
OL,9,Fspells in the morning. Increasingly
OL,10,Fstrong winds, especially over northern
OL,11,Fhills and near the west coast. Feeling
OL,12,Fcold.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FClear intervals this evening,
OL,15,Fthough cloud thickening overnight.
OL,16,FPatchy rain arriving in the west by
OL,17,Fthe morning. Strong winds easing.
OL,18,FThough milder than Friday night, a
OL,19,Fpatchy frost still likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
