OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FEarly bright spells, otherwise
OL,6,Fcloudy with rain and showers, becoming
OL,7,Fheavy and frequent at times. Lighter
OL,8,Fwinds until the evening, when coastal
OL,9,Fgales are possible. Feeling cold and
OL,10,Funpleasant.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FBright, but cold on Monday, with the
OL,14,Fodd wintry shower. Rain and possible
OL,15,Fhill snow arriving later and into
OL,16,FTuesday, before colder, sunnier
OL,17,Fweather returns for midweek.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
